    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;be three non - zero vectors such that no two of them are collinear and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>. If <math> <mrow> <mi>&#952;</mi> </mrow> </math> is the angle between vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext>&#160;and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then a value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math> is&nbsp;</p>"
